The issue is that the subagents used `pres.ChartType.bar` which may not be the correct API. Let me look at the pptxgenjs reference again. The reference shows using `pres.charts.BAR` with the data as the first argument:

```javascript
slide.addChart(pres.charts.BAR, [{
  name: "Sales", labels: ["Q1", "Q2", "Q3", "Q4"], values: [4500, 5500, 6200, 7100]
}], {
  x: 0.5, y: 0.6, w: 6, h: 3, barDir: 'col',
  showTitle: true, title: 'Quarterly Sales'
});
```

So the correct format is:
```javascript
slide.addChart(pres.charts.BAR, chartData, options);
```

Where chartData is an array of series objects. Let me fix slides 4 and 5.

